      {
        "text": "GUIDELINES ON ALTERATION & ADDITION (A&A)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "WORKS FOR COMMERCIAL TENANTS",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Edition 2025 (issued 3 February 2025). These guidelines explain what approvals tenants of HEB commercial",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "premises need before carrying out renovation or alteration and addition (A&A) works, and the conditions that",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "apply.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "1. Why Approval is Required",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "HEB commercial premises are mostly at the ground floor of residential blocks. Works that affect structural",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "elements, building services, fire safety provisions or the external facade can affect residents' safety and the",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "building's integrity. All A&A works therefore need HEB's written approval before they start, except for the minor",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "works listed in section 3.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "2. Categories of Works",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Category",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Examples",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Approval",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Processing time",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Exempt (minor)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Painting, loose furniture, shelving not fixed to walls,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "replacing light fittings",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Not required; notify Estate",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
