        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "(non-structural)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Partition walls (drywall), false ceilings, signage,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "shopfront glazing, electrical rewiring within unit",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Required",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "10 working days",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Category B (services)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Plumbing, grease traps, exhaust ducting,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "air-conditioning condensers, gas piping",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Required; licensed",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "contractors",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "14 working days",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Category C (structural)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Hacking of walls, new openings, mezzanine floors,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "floor screed > 50 mm, roof works",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Required; PE",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "endorsement",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "21 working days",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "3. Exempt Works",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Exempt works must not damage the structure, obstruct fire safety equipment or change the external",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "appearance. Tenants must still tell the Estate Manager at least 3 working days beforehand, so that complaints",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "from residents can be handled.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
