      {
        "text": "5. Conditions of Approval",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "1",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Works may only be done between 9.00 am and 6.00 pm on Mondays to Saturdays. Noisy works (hacking,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "drilling) are limited to 10.00 am - 5.00 pm.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "2",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "No works on Sundays or public holidays.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "3",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Debris must be bagged and removed daily, not left in common areas.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "4",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Hoarding must be put up for works lasting more than 3 days.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "5",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Fire safety provisions must stay operational at all times.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "6",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "The tenant must reinstate the premises at the end of the tenancy unless HEB agrees in writing otherwise.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "7",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Any damage to common property will be repaired at the tenant's cost.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "6. Fees",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Fee (before GST)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Category A processing fee",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "S$150",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Category B processing fee",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "S$250",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Category C processing fee",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "S$500",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Re-submission after rejection",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "50% of processing fee",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Inspection of completed works (Category C)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "S$200",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "7. Prohibited Works",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "\u007f",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Removal or weakening of columns, beams or load-bearing walls.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "\u007f",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Installation of cooking facilities in units not approved for F&B.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "\u007f",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Enclosure of common corridors or five-foot ways.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "\u007f",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Installation of gas cylinders above 2 x 50 kg in eating houses without CDA approval.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "\u007f",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Changes to the external facade colour scheme of the block.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "8. Unapproved Works",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "If works are carried out without approval, HEB may order them to stop, require the premises to be reinstated",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "within 30 days, and impose composition fees under PLG-POL-001 clause 8. Repeated breaches may lead to",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "termination being considered.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "9. Completion",
        "level": 1,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "The tenant must submit completion photos within 7 days of completing Category A and B works. Category C",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "works need a completion inspection and a PE certificate of supervision.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 2
      },
