        "text": "Annex 3 - Frequently Asked Questions",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Question",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Answer",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Do I need approval to change my signboard?",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Yes, Category A. Signboard must not exceed the shopfront width or",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "600 mm in height.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Can I install an air-con condenser on the external",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "wall?",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Only at designated condenser ledges (Category B).",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Can I knock down the wall between two units I rent?",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Category C with PE endorsement; both tenancies must be in the",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "same name.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "How long is the approval valid?",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Works must start within 3 months of approval and complete within 6",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "months.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 4
      },
