      {
        "text": "Annex 5 - Worked Examples",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Example 1: Shopfront and signage replacement (Category A)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "A florist wants to replace its aluminium shopfront with frameless glass and install a new lightbox sign.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Documents: AA, DWG (elevation showing sign dimensions), CON, MS, INS. No PE endorsement is needed.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Processing time: 10 working days. Fee: S$150.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Example 2: Grease trap and exhaust ducting for a new restaurant (Category B)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "A unit approved for change of trade to restaurant needs a grease interceptor and an exhaust duct to the roof.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Documents: AA, DWG (plumbing layout and duct route), CON (licensed plumber and M&E contractor), MS, INS.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "The duct route through common areas needs Town Council consent. Processing time: 14 working days. Fee:",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "S$250.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Example 3: Combining two adjoining units (Category C)",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "A tuition centre renting #02-05 and #02-06 wants to open the party wall. Documents: all of the above plus PE",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "endorsement with structural calculations and a lintel detail. Both tenancies must be in the same name and",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "expire on the same date. Processing time: 21 working days. Fees: S$500 processing plus S$200 completion",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "inspection. On termination, the wall must be reinstated unless HEB agrees otherwise.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Example 4: Works started without approval",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "During a routine inspection, a minimart is found to have installed a mezzanine for storage. It is a Category C",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "structural work done without approval. The Estate Manager issues a stop-work order. The tenant must remove",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "the mezzanine within 30 days and pay a composition fee of S$500 (POL-001 cl. 8). If the tenant wants to keep it,",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "they must submit a retrospective application with PE certification of the as-built structure. Approval is not",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "guaranteed.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Annex 6 - Approval Process Flow",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "1",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Tenant submits form PLG-AA-01 with documents to the Estate Manager (email or HEB branch).",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "2",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Leasing Officer checks completeness against the ALTERATION checklist within 3 working days; issues",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "TPL-DOC-02 if anything is missing.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "3",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Estate Manager assesses impact on structure, services, fire safety and neighbours; consults Civil &",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Structural for Category C.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "4",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Approval letter issued with conditions, or rejection with reasons.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "5",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Tenant notifies start date at least 3 working days in advance; Estate Manager may inspect during works.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "6",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Tenant submits completion photos or, for Category C, the PE certificate of supervision; Estate Manager",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "closes the case.",
        "level": 0,
        "page": 6
      },
      {
